This product includes a design inspired by and a runtime dependency on
Graphify (https://github.com/Graphlet-AI/graphify), Copyright 2026
Safi Shamsi, licensed under Apache-2.0 OR MIT. Graphify's graph
projection format is consumed via the pinned `graphifyy` package;
the observed dependency is pinned as graphifyy==0.9.95 (see
pyproject.toml and uv.lock).
Feature ideas adapted from Graphify were re-implemented from scratch
under this project's own architecture; no Graphify source code is
copied into this repository. See docs/research/ and
.superpowers/sdd/ for the adaptation mapping (ATM: observe, re-implement, modify).

This product's ingestion pipeline (contract v3 addendum) uses the
parser-category dependencies tree-sitter and tree-sitter-language-pack
(https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter,
https://github.com/Goldziher/tree-sitter-language-pack), Copyright the
tree-sitter contributors, licensed under MIT; and pypdf
(https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf), Copyright the pypdf contributors,
licensed under BSD-3-Clause. They are used as libraries only; no upstream
source code is copied into this repository.

Parser dependencies (Wave 2, Universal Knowledge Graph):
- tree-sitter-language-pack==1.22.1 (MIT) — tree-sitter grammars, compiled C
- pypdf==6.21.3 (BSD-3-Clause) — pure-Python PDF text extraction
